{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/extras/GIF_GamePlay_1.gif?t=1742487294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a trial version of <strong>\u300eMini Cozy Room: Lo-Fi\u300f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The trial version contains 25 out of 160 tracks and 5 out of 20 ambient sounds included in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300eMini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi\u300f</strong> is a relaxing productivity game that combines soothing Lo-Fi music with cozy room decoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute avatars and pets will accompany you, making your work more enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convenient desktop tools like Pomodoro timers, notes, and to-do lists will boost your productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>1. Your Own Cozy Workspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the workspace you've always dreamed of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from various rooms, furniture, and decorative items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your beautifully designed workspace will enhance concentration and productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/extras/GIF_GamePlay_2.gif?t=1742487294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>2. Soothing Lo-Fi Music &amp; Ambience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill your workspace with diverse Lo-Fi music genres and calming ambient sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll soon find yourself relaxed and deeply immersed in your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/extras/GIF_GamePlay_3.gif?t=1742487294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>3. Innovative Desktop UI and Mini Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely reposition and resize notes and to-do lists on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling overwhelmed by the large game screen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch to Mini Mode and conveniently place it in your taskbar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/extras/GIF_GamePlay_4.gif?t=1742487294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>4. Cute Avatars and Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express your unique style with diverse fashion options, hairstyles, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move adorable avatars to chairs, beds, or beanbags and assign tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lovely pets like cats, dogs, and hedgehogs will keep you company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>5. Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain experience points by listening to music. Higher levels deliver gift parcels to your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up to unlock new items and content!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy beautiful music and ambient sounds without the burden of streaming data.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Level Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550820/c517897d393dc0f377dc69281ff69c99c4b8e974.jpg"},{"name":"New Companion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550820/f2401bd5d20b5350085f905caec1edf565caf42f.jpg"},{"name":"100 Level Up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550820/c281c379ad4ca5093552cdd50b3fc86ebb69d11c.jpg"},{"name":"Task Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550820/7bfd2f22650d08dda399687b21d5bc9c0f3936cd.jpg"},{"name":"Time Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3550820/a4b02440e781803ad5507ecd9d949dc3867138dd.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3550820?t=1742487294","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/55f5319272b7c936c6e3af12c153f1e6c5a5173a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742487294","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/c736f55e33bee9ce9dfc60fa245d84f973a055a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742487294","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/c736f55e33bee9ce9dfc60fa245d84f973a055a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742487294","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/extras/GIF_GamePlay_1.gif?t=1742487294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a trial version of <strong>\u300eMini Cozy Room: Lo-Fi\u300f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The trial version contains 25 out of 160 tracks and 5 out of 20 ambient sounds included in the full version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300eMini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi\u300f</strong> is a relaxing productivity game that combines soothing Lo-Fi music with cozy room decoration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute avatars and pets will accompany you, making your work more enjoyable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Convenient desktop tools like Pomodoro timers, notes, and to-do lists will boost your productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>1. Your Own Cozy Workspace</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create the workspace you've always dreamed of!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from various rooms, furniture, and decorative items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your beautifully designed workspace will enhance concentration and productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/extras/GIF_GamePlay_2.gif?t=1742487294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>2. Soothing Lo-Fi Music &amp; Ambience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fill your workspace with diverse Lo-Fi music genres and calming ambient sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll soon find yourself relaxed and deeply immersed in your tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/extras/GIF_GamePlay_3.gif?t=1742487294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>3. Innovative Desktop UI and Mini Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely reposition and resize notes and to-do lists on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feeling overwhelmed by the large game screen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch to Mini Mode and conveniently place it in your taskbar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/extras/GIF_GamePlay_4.gif?t=1742487294\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>4. Cute Avatars and Pets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express your unique style with diverse fashion options, hairstyles, and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move adorable avatars to chairs, beds, or beanbags and assign tasks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lovely pets like cats, dogs, and hedgehogs will keep you company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>5. Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain experience points by listening to music. Higher levels deliver gift parcels to your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up to unlock new items and content!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy beautiful music and ambient sounds without the burden of streaming data.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Tesseract Studio","Nugem Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3511030","name":"Mini Cozy Room: Lo-Fi"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3550820/a058c94a117dbfd0c0b1b24770c7535f649307fa/header.jpg?t=1742487294","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257116343,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116343/movie480.mp4?t=1742402363","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116343/movie_max.mp4?t=1742402363"},"name":"MCR_2nd_Trailer_english","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257116343/67b3c59b4a94b033e4c05a17d246d68e9a32838a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742402363","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116343/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742402363","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257116343/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742402363"}}],"name":"Mini Cozy Room : Lo-Fi (Demo)","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 650 / AMD Radeon HD 7750 (DirectX 11 compatible)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Tesseract Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","des